`CASE` plus the raw column (the raw column breaks ties inside the custom
bucket only, because every known value has a distinct rank), and `assignee`
emits a null-rank key plus the folded name. The null-rank fragment is **always
ASC**, so unassigned stays last under `-assignee` and under `--reverse`.

