### Task 7: `br detach` — the command

Moves an issue out from under its parent. The CLI plumbing and the execution
logic land together: a registered subcommand that does nothing is not something a
reviewer can meaningfully accept or reject.

**Three ID shapes, three behaviours:**

| Shape | Behaviour |
| --- | --- |
| dotted (`ab-xxx.1`) | mint a flat ID, `rename_issue` to it, drop the `parent-child` dep |
