detector as well as enforcement — and `--force` on `close` stays available for
exactly the same reason.

`build_projection_info` (`src/cli/commands/info.rs:277`) already reports
graph-integrity parity: cached-versus-direct row counts, mismatched rows, child
counter rows. Divergence belongs beside them.

